Backport https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/16619 to Nix 2.35.3.
Upstream commit: 5231cef6e5d25bc6d60d9ee0f4041fafa862dd06

Adapt the builder header context and use this release's store reference
instead of a pointer. Keep the upstream sandbox bucketing unchanged.
Drop when the packaged release includes the upstream fix.

